New: Make the residual of the Stokes FAC preconditioners agree with the residual computed with IBAMR::StaggeredStokesOperator at quadratic PSEUDO_TRACTION boundaries, and add the quadratic PSEUDO_TRACTION term to the smoother of IBAMR::StaggeredStokesBoxRelaxationFACOperator. The Stokes FAC preconditioners use bdry_extrap_type from their boundary treatment or their own key.
